[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0010","text":"大家都在等着我们呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0020","text":"嗯……\n你们俩，没事吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0030","text":"嗯。来，做我们平时那个吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0040","text":"……从第一次围成圆阵的那天起\n这种感觉就一直没有变过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0050","text":"那种三个人在一起的话，就能去任何地方的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0060","text":"……突然说这个抱歉\n但刚才我就是这么想的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0070","text":"灯织"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0080","text":"心意是相通的……\n我们的心情……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0090","text":"……我们能走到多远呢\n我们"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0100","text":"是啊——……\n那就，到天涯海角！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0110","text":"那算回答吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0120","text":"真乃，拜托了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0130","text":"……那么……\n到宇宙的尽头……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0140","text":"把光芒传递给每一个人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0150","text":"illumination……STARS！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0160","text":"今后，我们也会觉得彼此的光芒耀眼夺目吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0170","text":"想成为却成为不了\n正因为明白这一点，我们才会不断伸出手"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0180","text":"三道光相互映照\n远去，更远去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0190","text":"如同劈开黑暗\n笔直倾洒而下般……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_99_0200","text":"直到宇宙的尽头"}]
